/T (Description:  This experiment demonstrates how to connect a GitHub-hosted Weather Application project with Azure DevOps. The pipeline is configured to integrate the project repository, validate project files, and automate basic build verification through Azure Pipelines. This ensures that project changes are tracked efficiently, supports continuous integration practices, and improves reliability and maintainability of the application throughout development. )
